### impl Trait for Type

#### parses impl trait for type

- Verify: parses impl trait for type


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 14 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: parses impl trait for type")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
trait Len:
    fn len() -> i64

struct MyList:
    size: i64

impl Len for MyList:
    fn len() -> i64:
        self.size

val list = MyList(size: 42)
expect list.len() == 42
```

</details>

